OL,3,AYou may get the right to find out what
OL,4,Ayour colleagues earn - here's why
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmployers in the UK are currently
OL,7,Fallowed to ask you how much you get
OL,8,Fpaid in your current role, but
OL,9,Fapplicants are under no obligation to
OL,10,Ftell them.
